flowchart TD
    L((L)) --> List[View all user accounts<br/>name · role badge · created date]
    List --> Act{Action?}
    Act -- Edit user --> Edit[Change name / assign role<br/>Barangay Secretary or Tanod]
    Edit --> Save[Save to profiles<br/>role enforced by Row-Level Security]
    Save --> R((R: Dashboard))
    Act -- View only --> R

    Role[Access model] --> Secretary[brgy_sec: full system access]
    Role --> Tanod[tanod: dashboard, crime, hotspot only]
    Role --> None[Unassigned user: gated access]
